<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Clockwork 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mplighttext>><<mplightambush>>
<br>
<<set $mpKeepsake to ($mpKeepsake or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
差分机底座弹出一只天鹅绒小匣，里面嵌着一枚蓝钢双游丝怀表芯与一张标着市政厅地下管网的蓝图。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回档案馆密库 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpLight to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="deep-clockwork-3">
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link "夹出怀表芯 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<mplight -5>><<replace "#deep-clockwork-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 360 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 360>>
	<<set $mpKeepsake["keepsake_clockwork_core"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_clockwork_blueprint"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_clockwork_blueprint"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你将蓝钢表芯与地下管网蓝图收进内袋。<span class="green">你获得了机括城信物与管网线索。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_clockwork_reward")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	擒纵叉在镊子尖弹了一下，齿轮簧片瞬间锁死，你连忙收手调整呼吸。<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 3]]>><<pass 4>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mplightloss>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mplightloss>>
</div>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[深入调速室 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 4]]>><<pass 4>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mplightloss>>

<br>
<<if $mpLightAmbush is 1>>
<<link [[摸黑应付 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 3]]>><<pass 4>><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<set $mpLightAmbush to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Abbey 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<mplightinit>><<mplighttext>><<mplightambush>>
<br>
暗河渡口石锚下方的铁链一直延伸进退潮后露出的拱券石洞，洞壁上刻着百年前苦修会留下的引路十字。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回暗河渡口 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Ferry]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpLight to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[踏入石洞 (0:07)|MP Extra Deep Abbey 2]]>><<mpalert 6>><<pass 7>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 460 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴着石壁潜入暗阶">><<mplightloss>>
