<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<mplighttext>><<mplightambush>>
<br>
<<set $mpKeepsake to ($mpKeepsake or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
石台暗格随机关开启，露出一枚刻着荆棘银鸽的苦修院院长指环，以及一卷记载旧神殿密道的羊皮手卷。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回暗河渡口 (0:04)|MP Region Abbey Ferry]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpLight to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="deep-abbey-3">
<<investigateicon>><<link "取银鸽指环 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<mplight -5>><<replace "#deep-abbey-3">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 360 or ($willpower or 0) gte 560>>
