	<<if ($mpFragAbyssPage or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragAbyssPage to ($mpFragAbyssPage or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你将银鸽指环与羊皮手卷妥善收起。<span class="green">你获得了修道院信物与神殿密道线索。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_abbey_reward")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	石龛内的蜂蜡封泥比预想更硬，指节磕在石棱上生疼，你只好先退开半步。<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Abbey 3]]>><<pass 4>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mplightloss>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "锁簧与石面的回声">><<mplightloss>>
