:: MP Extra Deep Blackiron 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<mplightinit>><<mplighttext>><<mplightambush>>
<br>
地下装卸台尽头的水闸旁，有一条早年停用的窄轨盲段，生锈的铁门后停着一节短小精悍的检道手摇车。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走私月台 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpLight to 0>><</link>>
<br>
