:: MP Extra Deep Blackiron 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<mplighttext>><<mplightambush>>
<br>
盲段隧道两侧的红砖墙龛里挂着一排老式铁路铜号牌，检道手摇车的工具箱上扣着一把字码铜锁。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走私月台 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpLight to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[拨开字码锁 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 3]]>><<mpalert 8>><<pass 8>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 310 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 310>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mpalertgain "铁件与道砟的响动">><<mplightloss>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[震开工具箱 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 3]]>><<mpalert 12>><<pass 8>><<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11900 or ($athletics or 0) gte 310>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mpalertgain "铁梯与碎石的回声">><<mplightloss>>

<br>
<<if $mpLightAmbush is 1>>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[摸黑应付 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 2]]>><<pass 4>><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<set $mpLightAmbush to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Blackiron 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<mplighttext>><<mplightambush>>
<br>
<<set $mpKeepsake to ($mpKeepsake or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
工具箱底层用油布包着一枚刻有黑铁蒸汽机车浮雕的站长纪念铜章，以及一份夜间专列秘密运单。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走私月台 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpLight to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="deep-blackiron-3">
<<investigateicon>><<link "取出站长铜章 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<mplight -5>><<replace "#deep-blackiron-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 360 or ($maths or 0) gte 350>>
	<<set $mpKeepsake["keepsake_blackiron_medal"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_blackiron_manifest"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_blackiron_manifest"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if ($mpFragLedgerKey or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragLedgerKey to ($mpFragLedgerKey or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你将站长纪念铜章与夜间运单贴身收好。<span class="green">你获得了货运站信物与夜间专列线索。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_blackiron_reward")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	铁锈渣卡住了暗格滑轨，你用力过猛震麻了虎口，只能先退开重找撬点。<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 3]]>><<pass 4>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mplightloss>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "铁件与道砟的响动">><<mplightloss>>
</div>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[深入调度室 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 4]]>><<mpalert 6>><<pass 4>><<mplight -5>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴着铁壁潜入盲段">><<mplightloss>>

<br>
<<if $mpLightAmbush is 1>>
<<link [[摸黑应付 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 3]]>><<pass 4>><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<set $mpLightAmbush to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Druid 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
林冠瞭望台基座后方的古橡树主干裂开一道天然树洞，洞内垂着一条用坚韧山藤编成的古老软梯。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林冠瞭望台 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[下探树心穴 (0:07)|MP Extra Deep Druid 2]]>><<pass 7>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[辨认踏脚槽 (0:07)|MP Extra Deep Druid 2]]>><<pass 7>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 460 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>


:: MP Extra Deep Druid 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
树心穴底部铺着厚厚的干松针，中央一块平整的月长石上刻着四季星象与森林水源的交汇符号。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林冠瞭望台 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[按动月长石 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Druid 3]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($history or 0) gte 310 or ($tending or 0) gte 310>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[洗去松脂层 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Druid 3]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($science or 0) gte 300 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 300>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>


:: MP Extra Deep Druid 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKeepsake to ($mpKeepsake or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
月长石下方的石龛里静静躺着一枚温润的白鹿角雕纹坠饰，旁边还压着一张标出深林古祭坛暗道的桦皮图。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林冠瞭望台 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="deep-druid-3">
<<investigateicon>><<link "捧出鹿角坠饰 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#deep-druid-3">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 360 or ($willpower or 0) gte 560>>
	<<set $mpKeepsake["keepsake_druid_antler"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_druid_birchmap"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_druid_birchmap"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragBrideFlower to ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你将白鹿角坠饰与桦皮暗道图郑重收好。<span class="green">你获得了古石环信物与深林暗道线索。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_druid_reward")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	古石环缝隙里的白苔湿滑异常，鹿角坠饰从指缝滑脱回去，你只得定神再试。<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Druid 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[深入引露台 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Druid 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

